  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/631ad0b4c1c80cdeebf0b154e3b2ddb677bcf2bd.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p><p>需要服務器供您和您的朋友嗎？點擊下面的圖片：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.apexminecrafthosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d16230\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.apexminecrafthosting.com/img/theme/apex-hosting-mobile.png\" alt=\"\"></a></h1>\n<h1>最小盔甲（可修剪）</h1>\n<p>此數據包會更改原生和一些模塊的盔甲，以便您能夠更多地看到自己的皮膚，同時也能夠看出您穿著盔甲。雖然其他人已經這樣做了，但讓我獨樹一幟的是它有模塊支持。</p>\n<h2>最新消息</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RH7R7xZwdo0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.5版本預告片</a></p>\n<h2>原生盔甲</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d35c20e6d265bb09bc2ebdcf50267c1651b0d88b.png\" alt=\"所有盔甲都已更新\"></p>\n<h2>邊緣</h2>\n<p>目前僅支持原生邊緣：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2c3972bc4f57ef40c792668f06fa1a1cea0fafe5.png\" alt=\"Trim 1\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/900fa96a63c18b40b78c33530ce034b0c7d39bc7.png\" alt=\"Trim 2\"></p>\n<h2>支持的模塊（查看圖庫中的樣式）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faquamirae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetternether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgalosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ficeandfire-ce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IceAndFire Community Edition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fl_enders-cataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agriculture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fovergeared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgeared</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-undergarden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您希望得到一個模塊的支持，請在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252fd9sgFWJdY14x8ia2A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Form</a>、這裡的評論或視頻中詢問。</p>\n<h2>我的社交媒體</h2>\n<p>我的YouTube：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@sirjumpy8772mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@sirjumpy8772mc</a></p>\n<p>我的TikTok：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540sirjumpy8772\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tiktok.com/@sirjumpy8772</a></p>",
